### Quick manual tests (VS Code "REST Client" extension, or just use Swagger UI)
@base = http://localhost:5001

### List all accounts
GET {{base}}/api/accounts

### Get one account
GET {{base}}/api/accounts/1

### Open a new account
POST {{base}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000003",
  "ownerName": "Naledi Khumalo",
  "accountType": "Savings",
  "balance": 5000.00,
  "currency": "ZAR"
}

### Update an account
PUT {{base}}/api/accounts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Thabo Mokoena",
  "accountType": "Cheque",
  "balance": 16000.00,
  "currency": "ZAR"
}

### Delete an account
DELETE {{base}}/api/accounts/3

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health
